        "text": "Very weird ecosystem: This random website, not clear if it’s a nonprofit, re-ripped our story from Public Health Watch and gave them double billing. Not sure it’s worth doing anything about it at this point, but it is instructive that syndication can get completely out of our hands if we don’t explicitly tell other sites not to re-syndicate to third parties without our permission.",
